## Scope implemented

This branch adds graceful shutdown modes while preserving the existing abort shutdown contract.

Public API now supports:

```js
await shutdownRuntime();
await shutdownRuntime({ mode: "abort" });
await shutdownRuntime({ mode: "drain" });
await shutdownRuntime({ mode: "drain-with-timeout", timeoutMs: 30000 });
```

Implemented behavior:

```text
abort:
  existing/default shutdown behavior preserved.
  blocks new intake, stops dispatch, cancels accepted queued/running work, rejects done promises, sends worker shutdown, waits for shutdown_done, terminates worker.

drain:
  blocks new intake immediately.
  leaves scheduler dispatch enabled.
  lets already accepted queued/running work finish.
  waits for scheduler idle.
  sends worker shutdown, waits for shutdown_done, terminates worker.

drain-with-timeout:
  blocks new intake immediately.
  leaves scheduler dispatch enabled while waiting.
  waits for scheduler idle or timeout.
  if timeout expires, stops scheduler dispatch and locally cancels/rejects remaining accepted work.
  sends worker shutdown, waits for shutdown_done, terminates worker.
```

