## Plan-review decisions preserved

Accepted:

```text
shutdown during active resetSession is not redesigned in this branch.
drain-with-timeout tests must not assert total shutdown returns within timeoutMs.
active-init guard is intentionally conservative.
full combined inference/scheduler canvases/checkpoints should be used before deeper stages.
worker file impact remains none unless a concrete need appears.
```

Accepted test strategy:

```text
Use bounded prompt-feeding to create realistic queue pressure.
Use reasonable small timeout values.
Stop prompt submission using hard safety caps.
Do not rely on infinite prompt spam.
Do not assert shutdownRuntime returns within timeoutMs.
```

