## Bottom line

`drain-shutdown-v1` is a parent-side lifecycle/shutdown feature branch. It adds graceful `drain` and bounded parent-side `drain-with-timeout`, preserves abort, fixes prompt admission re-checking after readiness, and rejects active-init shutdown conflicts.

The branch is verified for its intended scope. It intentionally does not solve native prompt preemption or broader worker lifecycle serialization.
